Hi {Owner},

I build websites for daycares and preschools around {City}. {Business Name} shares a warm classroom life on its social pages, but there's no site where a parent can book a tour or join the waitlist.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a day in each classroom, meals, allergies and nap, your state licence shown openly, a subsidy page, tour booking and an online waitlist, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and openings updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone during nap time?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
